PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Accused / Applicant most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Discharge the Accused / Applicant {applicant_name} from the charges under {offences_charged} in {case_type} No. {case_number} of [YEAR] under Section {applicable_section} of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, there being no sufficient ground for proceeding against him;

b) Award costs of this application;

c) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Applicant shall ever pray.
